      "label": "fearful expression",
      "description": "The Black man running away from police officers displays a clear expression of fear, as indicated by his hurried movement, body posture, and the tense context of being chased. His facial expression, though partially obscured, suggests urgency and apprehension.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
